# Claude Desktop keypad
# Shortcuts verified by reading /Applications/Claude.app app.asar menu definitions.
#   logikit build "Claude Profile" --file claude.keys --replace

# ---------- Page 1: daily driving ----------
New Chat    | Cmd+N         | #2B1B12 | #F0A882
Palette     | Cmd+K         | #2B1B12 | #F0A882
Sidebar     | Cmd+\         | #2B1B12 | #F0A882
Find        | Cmd+F         | #1A1A1A | #FFFFFF
Find Next   | Cmd+G         | #1A1A1A | #FFFFFF
Back        | Cmd+[         | #1A1A1A | #FFFFFF
Forward     | Cmd+]         | #1A1A1A | #FFFFFF
Claude Code | Cmd+Shift+O   | #12233F | #7FB4FF
Settings    | Cmd+,         | #1A1A1A | #FFFFFF

---

# ---------- Page 2: window and view ----------
Reload      | Cmd+R         | #1A1A1A | #FFFFFF
Full Screen | Ctrl+Cmd+F    | #1A1A1A | #FFFFFF
Zoom In     | Cmd+=         | #1A1A1A | #FFFFFF
Zoom Out    | Cmd+-         | #1A1A1A | #FFFFFF
Actual Size | Cmd+0         | #1A1A1A | #FFFFFF
Find Prev   | Cmd+Shift+G   | #1A1A1A | #FFFFFF
Paste Plain | Cmd+Alt+Shift+V | #1A1A1A | #FFFFFF
Close Win   | Cmd+W         | #3A1212 | #FF9B9B
Quit Claude | Cmd+Q         | #3A1212 | #FF9B9B
